From: Codex <codex@local>
Subject: [PATCH] driver core: remove diagnostic per-device emergency shutdown log

Remove only the pre-existing unconditional KT device-name emergency log.
Its shutdown flood overwrote the earlier diagnostic context in the fixed
ramoops console ring. Retain every existing lock, PM operation, shutdown
callback, conditional debug message, and their ordering. No new headers,
parameters, hardware operations or callback changes.

--- a/drivers/base/core.c
+++ b/drivers/base/core.c
@@ -4865,7 +4865,6 @@
 		device_lock(dev);
 
 		/* Don't allow any more runtime suspends */
-		pr_emerg("KT: dev %s\n", dev_name(dev));
 		pm_runtime_get_noresume(dev);
 		pm_runtime_barrier(dev);
 
